e compass moved); the third cut at 0x909da0 (after 0x909d4c's own recompute, before its children loop) re-applies the shift there. 0151 S2: the bit-7 guard moved to after the matcher -- a hidden pane's Calculate clears bit 7, so the old guard skipped it forever and hide->show was dead (#66); a matched pane with a table entry is never skipped now, while a never-calculated pane with no entry is still skipped on its first frame. 0151 S3: an All with a 'PicView' child matches compass (MapMiniPlayer's red needle; MapPlayer's PicView sits under Icon00, so the full-screen map does not match). 0147 layout-aware matcher: only a layout's 'All' container is ever matched (the display side), identified by its direct children -- compass: 'PicMap' child (MapMini) or 'PicView' child (MapMiniPlayer); lives: 'Life' child (CounterLife/Kids/Up); moons: 'Shine' child with a 'TxtShine' child (CounterShine); coins/regional: 'Add' child, told apart by the 'Capture' sibling's tx under the same RootPane (0 = CounterCoin, 130 = CounterCollectCoin; another tx falls back to All tx, nearest of -740/-615; no Capture sibling matches nothing). The old name matcher is gone: 'PicStrap' (BootLoading strip), 'Counter' (moon-tower container), 'TxtGuide01' (hints) and the capture content panes ('TxtCounterSh'/'TxtCounter'/'TxtIconSh'/'TxtIcon' under Capture00-03) are never matched -- moving content panes emptied the 128x128 capture texture (R1, log-51: a manual value moved the glyphs out of the texture and restoring never repainted it), and the name matches hit the wrong layouts (R2). Hints and the white bar have no matcher entry and stay hidden in the overlay. Restore: a mask-0 element takes no table entry and writes nothing; a pane with an existing entry has its local (+0x30/+0x48) and its local matrix (+0xa0) written back to e_orig / e_lm0 (its first-seen local, the overlay's default edge position) and is marked dirty (flags bit 4) so the game recomposes +0x70 from the restored matrix; +0x70 itself is